ssings from shops or random events. These Blessings not only boost your stats but also change the way your skills attack, allowing you to craft a unique combat style and make your squad stronger with every battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u6e38\u620fEN-3.gif?t=1742284236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe-EN3.png?t=1742284236\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After your adventure, <strong>base building is where the real challenge begins!</strong> Use the resources you bring back to unlock new buildings and gameplay, creating your very own <strong>adventurer\u2019s paradise!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can recruit more companions with unique abilities at the tavern, or improve your adventurers\u2019 skills at the training ground to prepare for the next adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u6e38\u620fEN-4.gif?t=1742284236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/\u6807\u9898\u56fe-EN4.png?t=1742284236\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t fear death! <strong>Every failure is an opportunity to grow stronger!</strong> Collect resources to unlock new characters, cards, and buildings, making your squad more powerful with each defeat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clearing the game is just the beginning. Higher difficulties, stronger enemies, and more bizarre weather and terrain are waiting for you to conquer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u6e38\u620fEN-5.gif?t=1742284236\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If our game has caught your interest, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p>","developers":["ForindGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/01b50f31c9d2a3d27d601c4a45a9aed991d13677/header.jpg?t=1742284236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115291,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115291/movie480.mp4?t=1742284232","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115291/movie_max.mp4?t=1742284232"},"name":"Playtest - EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115291/982e333a45f926e2a78051f5c666af1428409cf6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742284232","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115291/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742284232","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115291/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742284232"}}],"name":"Fadedlands: The Reckless Squad","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU @ 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 630 or 